    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nukes on the Loose is a competitive card game set in a cold war era arms trading situation. Rivaling leaders compete for the best gadgets in order to win their war effort. But there are dangerous dirty bombs at play. Protect yourself with gadgets like shield generators and bomb technicians. Play on the offence by using cruise missiles or EMPs against the rivaling leaders. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire the best gadgets and avoid getting blown up by a dirty bomb! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-6 players competitive card game </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Turn based </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Acquire parts to assemble essential gadgets </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use acquired vetos to block other leaders from taking action </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Avoid drawing a dirty bomb </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > More than 25 different cards </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Create custom decks to play with your friends </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unlock leader titles, cardbacks and a unique city background</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nukes on the Loose is a competitive card game set in a cold war era arms trading situation. Rivaling leaders compete for the best gadgets in order to win their war effort. But there are dangerous dirty bombs at play. Protect yourself with gadgets like shield generators and bomb technicians. Play on the offence by using cruise missiles or EMPs against the rivaling leaders. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire the best gadgets and avoid getting blown up by a dirty bomb! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-6 players competitive card game </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Turn based </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Acquire parts to assemble essential gadgets </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use acquired vetos to block other leaders from taking action </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Avoid drawing a dirty bomb </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > More than 25 different cards </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Create custom decks to play with your friends </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unlock leader titles, cardbacks and a unique city background</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Compete with up to 5 other players to see who can avoid getting blown up by the hidden dirty bombs in this thrilling card game. Play secrets, veto cards, cruise missiles and a lot more. Only 1 player can survive and save their city!",
